From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: oop23 <ilidans01yt@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 10 Oct 2026 04:42:53 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Screen format button: aspect ratio icon and a label

The 'original' format was shown as a bare '0'. It now uses the aspect
ratio symbol, and every switch briefly names the chosen format
(Original, Fullscreen, Stretched, 16:9...).
